# Database Migration Guidelines

## Migration Process
- **Username**: marcel
- **Database**: slam25_db
- Always run migrations automatically when created
- Delete migration files after successful application

## Schema Files
- Main schema: [database/schema.sql](mdc:database/schema.sql)
- Prisma schema: [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma)
- Migration directory: [database/migrations/](mdc:database/migrations/)

## Key Tables
- `timetable_entries` - Event scheduling with new categories
- `city_tips` - Location recommendations with slugs
- `news` - News articles with breaking news support
- `links` - Important links for members
- `countdown_config` - Configurable countdown settings
- `user_sessions` - User authentication with refresh tokens

## Timetable Categories
Valid event types: `team-round`, `individual-round`, `workshop`, `fun`, `aftershow`, `general`

## Migration Commands
```bash
# Apply migration
psql -U marcel -d slam25_db -f database/migrations/[filename].sql

# Check table structure
psql -U marcel -d slam25_db -c "\d [table_name]"
```
